# Tenant RBAC vs Platform RBAC

| Aspect | Tenant RBAC | Platform RBAC |
|--------|-------------|---------------|
| **Scope** | Tenant-specific operations | Platform-wide operations |
| **Authentication** | Tenant token (`tenantAccessToken`) | Identity token (`identityAccessToken`) |
| **Use Cases** | Documents, team, settings | Tenant management, global templates, system admin |
| **Guard** | `TenantPermissionsGuard` | `PlatformPermissionsGuard` |
| **Decorators** | `@RequireAnyTenantPermission()` | `@RequireAnyPlatformPermission()` |
| **Roles** | `tenant_admin`, `legal_counsel`, `member`, `viewer` | `system_admin`, `support`, `auditor` |

